<title>USA: Terra Industries, Britz end talks on stake.</title>
<headline>Terra Industries, Britz end talks on stake.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY, Iowa 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Terra Industries Inc said Wednesday a letter of intent to buy a 50-percent stake in Britz Fertilizers Inc has been terminated.</p>
<p>Terra and Britz, a farm service distribution network based in Fresno, California, indicated they were unable to agree on several issues related to the deal.</p>
<p>Terra produces and markets nitrogen fertilizer, crop protection products, seeds and services to the agricultural industry.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading off 1/8 Wednesday at 14-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
